cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the software through its Zenodo concept DOI
  (10.5281/zenodo.20410480, which resolves to the latest archived version) and the
  article it was written for (preferred-citation below).
type: software
title: MedClim analysis code for Mediterranean thermohaline acceleration analysis
abstract: >-
  Mediterranean hydrographic processing and analysis workflows: preprocessing of
  SeaDataNet, Argo and regional Adriatic observations, basin-based seasonal
  climatologies and monthly series by standard-depth bin, linear and quadratic trend
  fits, and the manuscript figures of Terzić and Vilibić (Geophysical Research Letters,
  2026).
